This repository is **Takt**, a native WPF mouse jiggler + autoclicker.

Before implementing, follow:

- `.cursor/skills/takt-architecture/SKILL.md` — product boundaries, folders, settings, safety
- `.cursor/skills/win32-input-engine/SKILL.md` — SendInput, timers, hotkeys, failsafe
- `.cursor/skills/wpf-compact-desktop/SKILL.md` — compact UI, tray, themes, i18n

Do not add Electron, extra UI frameworks, stealth features, or settings files next to the exe.
